{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SettingsScope","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"open","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the records the caller did ask for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" is never written: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses it locally, before any request, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"validation failure (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P12.2, contract 1.60 A4) — never as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\""},{"type":"text","text":", never left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to refuse. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"type":"text","text":" over these cases needs an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" arm."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/Se","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SE","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SH","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SY","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SettingsScope"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13SettingsScopeO","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SettingsScope"}],"title":"SettingsScope"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/org","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/tenant","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/unknown"]},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/init(from:)-5xa6k","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/init(rawValue:)"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/encode(to:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SettingsScope\/RawRepresentable-Implementations"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether a settings row belongs to an organization or a tenant."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/settingsscope"]